# PROJECT: FIVONIX — COMPLETE CORPORATE WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, production-quality, multi-page corporate website for a company named **FIVONIX**.

Reference website:
https://vvon.com.bd/

Use the reference website to understand the business structure, information architecture, navigation, content depth, catalogue functionality, industry segmentation, and overall corporate presentation.

The objective is to recreate a website with comparable depth and functionality while creating an original FIVONIX brand identity and visual design.

This is NOT a basic startup landing page. It must look and function like a serious engineering, scientific equipment, renewable energy and technology solutions company.

Company name: FIVONIX

Brand tagline:
Engineering Tomorrow. Enabling Progress.

Primary market: Bangladesh.

Target customers:
- Universities and polytechnic institutes.
- Hospitals and medical colleges.
- Scientific research institutes.
- Industrial and manufacturing companies.
- Government organizations.
- Corporate institutions.
- Energy and infrastructure developers.

