## 13. FAQ SECTION

Create an expandable FAQ section.

Questions and answers:

Q: What does FIVONIX do?

A: FIVONIX focuses on engineering, specialized equipment and technology solutions across renewable energy, scientific and laboratory equipment, nuclear medicine, medical equipment and advanced research technologies.

Q: Who can work with FIVONIX?

A: We aim to support universities, hospitals, research organizations, industrial companies, government institutions and other organizations with specialized technical requirements.

Q: Can FIVONIX help select equipment?

A: Yes. Share your application, technical requirements, expected usage and budget considerations. Our team can help identify suitable equipment categories and configurations.

Q: How can I request a quotation?

A: Browse our catalogue, select the required products and submit an enquiry with your organization and project details. You can also contact our team directly.

Q: Does FIVONIX provide installation and commissioning?

A: Installation and commissioning support can be discussed according to the equipment, project requirements and agreed scope of work.

Q: Can I request multiple products in one enquiry?

A: Yes. Add multiple products to your enquiry list and submit them together.

Q: Does FIVONIX support projects outside Dhaka?

A: Project support outside Dhaka can be discussed based on the site location, technical requirements and agreed scope.

